msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You only had two lessons?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm spent from all this learning."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for the lessons, Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/c-10/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Look. My wisdom's simple n'clean."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/c-10/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Little contractin' wisdom for ya—you get the job done faster'n cheaper you can pocket the rest for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/c-11/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "It IS a lot to take in, I know."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/c-12/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "School's out, nerd. Cut that shit out!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-2/13/c-13/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You know I got you!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Now that that's all over... let's hear it. Gimme your feedback."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Let me know what I can do for the next suck-"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I mean, student."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This was amazing. I just have a few notes."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No notes. You're perfect."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You need to hang up your hard hat. You're a fraud."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-14/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Oh yeah? Lay it on me."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-15/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I knew you had a good eye."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-15/21
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "This right here's solid construction, baby."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-15/29
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "So now that you're an expert, let's just test all that new knowledge you got."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-16/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "What the hell! That ain't feedback!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-16/18
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ain't you ever heard 'a constructive feedback?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/third_encounter/0/g-4/24/c-16/26
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "It's called constructive 'cause it helps ya construct things, understand?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't ignore people you like. You talk with them, flirt, etcetera."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Hmmm ... I don't know about that."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You also don't try to be someone you're not. Just be yourself."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Yeah, I think I want a second opinion."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Y'know, on account of your roh-mantic life being a dumpster fire. No offense."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't have to be a romantic prodigy to know bad advice when I hear it."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "None taken. It's a very pot-meet-kettle situation."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "We're gonna need to bring Rainey in here. And by we I mean you."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Rainey as in record player Rainey?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Yeah, that's the one. A real doll. Real musical genius."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "The record player. Rainey!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not hauling a record player in here, Tony. And also, why?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean I can talk to her I guess?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Rainey happens to know more about affairs of the heart."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Y'know on account of all the love songs."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/23
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Besides. You can see the ol' Tony charm in action on someone else."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/31
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ergo, i.e., etcetera, you gotta bring the water to the horse."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/39
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "And besides. You owe me for the relationship advice."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All of which amounted to \"Ignore anyone you have a crush on\" and \"Hide your problems.\""
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-3/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Well anything sounds stupid when you say it all shitty."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Talk, haul. Same difference in the construction biz."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Now get out there and make me proud, kid."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_LoveAdvice/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Don't forget to talk to Rainey next time you come through. I'm gonna take lunch."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cool. Ask me a question."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Okay. What is the capital of Turks and Caicos?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I meant a question about dating-"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Cockburn Town!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "The capital 'a Turks n' Caicos, and also what happens when ya swing that hammer a little too freely if you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You know, hammer..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I got it, hammer, penis. I made the connection."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gosh, you mean like demolition?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You get it? Hahaha. Yeeeahhh... you get it."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Naw, naw. Y' know... the ol' cannoli. Spicy Italian sausage."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "The freaky meat stromboli. The tubesteak of love?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, those are all so delicious."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "...you're makin' it less fun. I can't be the one to explain this to ya."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Well anyway. Alright, alright. You want I should ask you some questions about datin'."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Alright."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You're at the movies and your date pulls the ol' yawn and stretch move. Classic, but a little outdated."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "What d'you do?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I let it happen and snuggle into them."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I loudly ask 'WHAT ARE YOU DOING?'"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Our hands collide in mid-air, because I was doing that too."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Aww... that's cute, but dontcha think you deserve someone bolder'n that?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's nothing wrong with the classic moves."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Hmm... noted."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Whoah woah woah. Not cool!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Your date is kind of a dweeb for pullin' that but it ain't no reason to insult 'em!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You too? Yeesh."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You're too cute to be pullin' amateur moves like that. Believe in yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Now a real date would just tell ya how hot you are and put their arm around ya with no pretext, but we ain't all me."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "We all gotta start somewhere, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "But your date should know they gotta do better."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Alright. Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Your date asks ya how you got so damn sexy and why your construction is so impeccable."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Your answer?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I clutch at my face and wonder how I woke up as Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are we out of questions already?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tell them I was simply born this way."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ha! You tryna butter me up?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "It's <i>working</i>."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Why would you say that? It's a real common question."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I get asked that just about every day."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Ohh that's a good one, I'll have to try that one out."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe instead of all these hypotheticals I could just give you some of my own advice."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Man you learn real quick, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_advice_try/0/g-2/c-7/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Alright, shoot."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your advice is like you putting a swimming pool in the middle of my living room with nothing but a hammer and screwdriver."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "WHEN YOU'RE AS GOOD AS I AM THAT'S ALL YOU NEED!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See what I mean?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You know what? I've had about enough of your negative attitude."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You are hereby booted from my workshop! Banned for life!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/23
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "And I'm keeping the registration fee!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What registration fee?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "The twenty dollars that you dropped in my supplies last December!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't belong to you!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/Tony_Offended/0/c-0/18/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "IT DOES NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/tony_rainey_wait/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "What are you doin' here? I need to meet up with Rainey and I need you to like, play referee or some shit."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/tony_rainey_wait/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I gotta get back to work!"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Hey all this talk with Rainey got me thinking about my favorite kinda music."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What kind?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't tell me..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Rock music."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Believe me, I know about rocks. You don't work construction and not know your rocks."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I mean on demolition sites alone..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I got you brand new from the store, Tony. When have you ever set foot on a demolition site?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me more..."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You know, as lead foreman I really don't get the respect I'm owed around here."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Have you talked to the the roof yet? That guy don't give me any respect."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why would I — what does the roof have to do with anything?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I had an uncle once. Uncle Ton'."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your uncle was also named Tony?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean 'once'?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "We're all named Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Oh, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your dad?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/7 tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your brothers?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "One brother."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your great-great-grandpa?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Big Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your great-great-grandma."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Toni with an 'I'."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Same with my mom and all my aunts."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "'cept my sister Conchetta."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Anyway my uncle."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "One time uncle."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "You humans have those?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Then you understand."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-1/c-5/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "It's like you got a tool you're close with, then he leaves the box one day never to be seen again."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "My Uncle Ton' fell off a crane on a job."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I'm talkin' eighty maybe ninety feet."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Cracked wide open. Parts everywhere."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Holy shit."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why are we talking about this?"
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-6/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-6/18
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "I miss him everyday."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry for your loss, Tony."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-6/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "Oh, he ain't dead."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-6/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Tony"
msgid "The old bastard's retired in a basement somewhere in Poughkeepsie. Disability."
msgstr ""

#: tony_toolbox/rock_chat/0/g-2/24/c-7/7
